{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"850786156479119391","name":"central-park🏞","position":52,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'...hey, Lucy, you alright?'","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:48:51.213000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229087691341834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Lucy is a celestial. Maybe the archdevil business really bothers her.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:49:04.112000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229141793689640","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"It's not her scene.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:49:08.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229158361194497","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I'll send Kukudh to go talk to Bo, then... just to be sure.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:49:28.833000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229245481078844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Probably. But, then again, I still have no idea how in the world I didn't die from what i did.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:50:12.438000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229428373717022","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"`Hey, me tooooooo. Race you there, kid!` And Orphy takes off to the Ordinary.","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:50:16.299000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229444567912470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I mean... they're already in Hampstead...'","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:50:28.369000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229495193141300","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Maybe because you didn't do it.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:50:30.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229502231195648","reply_to_id":"878229428373717022","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"No, he's.. he's racing me.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:50:46.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229569478488144","reply_to_id":"878229495193141300","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She looks at Irynx. \"You don't think I opened myself to two polar opposite beings of immeasurable power and have both of them use me as their voices?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:51:50.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878229841483276318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I mean, you didn't do what this archdevil made you do. Wasn't you. Whatever that old devil did, you didn't do them.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:52:56.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230115287461928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Oh afterwards? Yeah I asked Nolan about why they didn't simply kill me.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:53:56.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230366375260210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Again, because that's not your fault.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:54:19.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230463276273724","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Think of this weirdo possession like a disease.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:54:48.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230587431845928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she nods, though slightly hesitantly. 'If I can't be blamed for things happening in my past, before I was me... you definitely can't be blamed for this.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:54:52.526000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230603147927562","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Do you kill the afflicted?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:54:53.258000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230606218154015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Just because they have the sick in them?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:55:01.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230638820491284","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"It's really reducing the situation but best way to describe it, to be honest.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:55:23.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230734941347870","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Among all of us, fighting for the city, I don't see why any of us would willingly kill anyone else.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:55:46.395000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230829090885652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Oh I don't blame myself for that. A pissed off archdevil is not something you can simply push out of your body, especially if it's what I was made to be.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:56:21.066000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878230974511603772","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"We need to make sure that we can't be forced to do anything against our wills. What if... what if that archdevil decides you need to turn on Lucy because she's an angel? I mean that literally but metaphorically she is also definitely an angel.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:57:01.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878231144934551612","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"So uh, your deal with Mr. Malathor was not a bad move.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:57:25.413000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T10:57:34.824000Z","id":"878231244402491392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"At least in my eyes.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:57:29.609000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878231262001791006","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Sabrine nods. 'I... wish I could give you some advice from my time bound to the ***Thing***. But I think it was mostly... biding its time, and I went under Mender's protection before it could pull anything...'","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:58:13.625000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878231446618247168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Speaking of, be careful with the Speaker of the Dead. He gave himself up to an evil underworld demigod. I'm still waiting on that to bite us all in the ass one day. It can't be good.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T10:59:46.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878231835413479434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She shrugs again. \"If my parents find out, guess the only family I'll have is Athena and Zariel. I don't know what happened to Johnathan, and I doubt he'd want to be with me after being corrupted by an archdevil after willingly letting her and Athena use me as a vessel to try and explain why Malathor deserved to be imprisoned.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:00:51.528000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232108911439882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'No.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:01:04.937000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232165152870440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she stands up, slightly wobbly. 'You'll have me, too.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:01:13.509000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232201106440192","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I'm not... abandoning a sister again.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:01:40.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232314008702987","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Do you visit Murry Hill often, Secel?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:01:49.953000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232353963671552","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She shakes her head. \"I barely leave the docks.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:02:11.554000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232444564820018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"There's a strange stone in the park. On it you can find an inscription: 'Within love and hope the bond of family is found that no darkness can divide'.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:02:56.444000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232632847126579","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I think we can trust a person who'd write something like that in a place like that would know what they're talking about.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:03:40.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232819095187457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She shrugs again.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:04:12.531000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878232951979118602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You may not believe it immediately, but trust that others might.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:04:46.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233095214608424","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I need to talk to Mender later anyway. About... the flashback. If you'd like, I can introduce you?'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:05:19.745000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233233895092235","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'I'm sure he'd be willing to help ease your worries.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:05:32.595000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233287791882271","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Sab, as much as we know Mender could help, I think Secel might need some rest and time to think about things. Let's not rush anything.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:02.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233413147041832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'...fair point. Apologies.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:14.435000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233463281561630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"The Mender is a wonderful conversationalist, if anything. He's great to talk to.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:21.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233491542794322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Though maybe it's because we're both old.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:32.140000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233537541726269","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"So we just understand each other.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:38.028000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233562237796364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'So extend that to whenever you'd want to, I can introduce you. And you know you can talk to me any time... sis.' she tears up a little at the last word.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:06:53.594000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233627526320159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Eliot sets himself up far from the others beneath a large tree. He quietly makes himself tea, his hands shaking again, his eyes red and puffy. His clothes in tatters and covered in blood.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:07:00.360000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233655904993340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Who knows, you might be older than him, really.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:07:16.337000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233722917355521","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“My family spent *twenty-two years* trying to prevent me from becoming a vessel of Zareil’s words. I became that today. Trust me, having 22 years of work flushed down the river doesn’t go over well with parents that would have killed me from the start.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:08:15.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878233972025475122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Are you speaking their words right now?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:08:55.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234138606469170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Sabrine goes over to Eliot. 'I'm not quite sure what happened, but are you alright? Can I heal your wounds? I understand if you'd rather not talk right now, though.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:09:08.660000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234194034184212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"He quietly shakes his head, but offers a cup of tea in his silence.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:10:29.454000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234532908789790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"She barks out a laugh. “And you think that will change their minds? I let her in! She corrupted me. They would have no remorse trying to purge a devilspawn like me.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:10:35.036000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234556321398834","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she takes the tea and nods, 'If you ever want to talk, you know where I am.' and heads back over to Secel.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:11:00.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234663464869928","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'By that logic, I should have been, ah... re-killed long ago.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:11:30.887000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234790577438730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Why did you let her in?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:12:02.700000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878234924010844181","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"My family pretty much kicked me out by sending me here on a 'mission' because I was in my brother's way for succession of a tiny town in the middle of nowhere, even though I never cared about running anything. Wanna know what I'm doing? I'm cutting them out just the same. You can still forge your life here over your mistakes, whether they support you or not.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:12:49.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878235118932746291","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Sabrine nods, not really able to talk about family herself.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:13:30.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878235293751332924","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Her gaze flicks to Irynx. “I asked them for help to kill a common enemy. They asked me why they should prevent Malathor’s imprisonment. Everyone knows I don’t trust Malathor. They’d just think it’s bias, when it’s really the two powerful beings that have been with me for my entire life.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:14:45.209000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878235605623013406","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"They chose Mal's punishment over your safety, it sounds like.\" Roy shakes his head.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:17:54.098000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878236397880893481","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I cut my family out first. Because I became someone I didn't want them to know. But, after I met Orphy, I did go home. I went to see my family. I didn't talk to them, but I saw them, learned how sad they were that I disappeared. I even went to see where they 'buried' me. It's a whole thing. It's not the same as you guys, I was the one who left, and I wanted to come back, but, well. Yes. That was my situation.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:19:46.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878236869949812747","reply_to_id":"878235118932746291","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'...' Sabrine looks like she's going to cry at Irynx's words.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:20:47.217000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878237123994611753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Actually, they chose his punishment and my safety. They have plans for me, and I know they loose me, that’s 22 years of plans gone. It was my choice to let them use me as a conduit for their voices.” She shrugs. “Best reason I can tell why I didn’t die is my bloodline.” She then turns to Irynx. “They let you come back?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:22:42.853000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878237609007144991","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I'm still part of the swarm and work for the greater swarm. But I do it my way. Arcania deserves a better swarm.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:23:02.745000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878237692440215602","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Well, it's not like I was their little Iryne anymore. It had been a solid 100 years since that girl disappeared. We saw each other at my grave, my mother and I. She didn't know it was me. But she asked me to hug her when she talked about her daughter. Said I reminded her of.... sorry, I, these are old memories.\" She's on the verge of crying.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:25:37.863000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T11:26:08.306000Z","id":"878238343052271646","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"My story is not actually the point here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:25:50.414000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238395694985266","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Sabrine hugs Irynx, if allowed.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:25:52.157000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238403005648906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she's also crying slightly.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:26:44.593000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238622938198047","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Secel, if that situation was anything like one from earlier, there is time to stop everything and enact judgement or deliver punishment, and there's time to ensure safety. If Mal is guilty of something, whether he's caught and tried now or next year shouldn't matter, compared to a giant spider right in front of yall at the very moment.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:26:47.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238634153742356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Also, Secel, didn't you worry Nolan and the others would kill you? Surely Athena and the archdevil would have considered that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:27:46.638000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238883173781544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Not thinking about how everyone would deal with you was already kind of a disregard to your bodily safety.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:28:13.079000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878238994075357184","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Thank goodness Nolan and the others are good people at least. Because even if someone wants stop the archdevil or Athena, it's still your body that bleeds, you know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:29:06.147000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T11:30:25.647000Z","id":"878239216658694214","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“I mean, beats your parents resisting the urge to smite you as a newborn.” She looks at Roy. “Thing is, that demon was sent for him, and only him. He stole something from someone, and they wanted him for it.” She then looks back to Irynx. “I asked him why they didn’t just kill my body. He said everyone decided to take a gamble. A gamble that could have ended worse for them then they could know.” A shiver runs up her spine.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:30:51.898000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878239660210520144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"she switches to hugging Secel.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:31:23.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878239791345434625","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Weeeell, that's Mr. Mal's words for it. I think it's because our friends care about you and did not want to hurt you.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:32:25.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878240053036458034","reply_to_id":"878239660210520144","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"'People care about you. As you deserve.'","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:32:50.379000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878240157155880990","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“For all they knew I was dead. When you’re bleeding like a stuck pig from every orifice and can barely get words out without it being painful, I might as well have been when she took over.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:35:42.225000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878240877930225715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Dead means nothing in this city, Secel. Don't you know?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:37:25.163000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878241309683486771","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"(I'll afk, need to go wash dishes; Sabrine will be on general comforting duty, and if the group disperses before I get back she'll head to Murry Hill, unless anyone asks her to go somewhere with them)","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:37:50.924000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878241417732972584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I was dead within last month. I was ready to give up and let history take its path. And here I am.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:39:18.386000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878241784575172648","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Even if you were dead, people would have fought tooth and nail to bring you back.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:39:55.332000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T11:40:21.559000Z","id":"878241939537928242","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“This is different.” She sighs. “Imagine if you put two elements that don’t mix and force them into a single container. In this case, I am the container, and the powers of a goddess and an archdevil are the elements.” She shakes her head. “I heard stories of people trying to tame the two in a single vessel, or harness the two to make them one. It never ends well.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:41:30.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878242338399465502","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I only hope that the container stays shut then. I want to have *Secel* in this body, helping the city and being my friend. Not Athena, and not an archdevil.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:43:00.832000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878242717581324308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“I can’t promise that.” She says, reaching up to grab her necklace.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:44:29.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878243087648960513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"And why can't you?\" She tilts her head.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:45:17.408000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878243290422591578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Because the container has been opened already.” She firmly states.","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:46:21.869000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878243560791609355","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"So this is like... an irreversible situation kind of deal? Why bother dealing with Mr. Malathor then? I know I'm not that smart but the logic doesn't seem super sound to me.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:47:40.621000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878243891101450260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“It’s possible, but I fear that if I’m not careful, I’ll sever an already fragile link with Athena. If I can prevent an unwanted possession, then I will be all for it. But if it severs my ability to willingly have Athena take over, or worse yet, loose my ability to call on her….”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:50:51.061000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878244689864712202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Well, I'm all for careful. Sometimes the safest gamble is a deal with a devil. Metaphorically speaking. Between an archdevil, like Nine Hells sort of mess, and a sketchy old tiefling, I would pick the tiefling.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:53:34.680000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878245376132538428","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“But when that archdevil has been with you for 22 years, and you have a connection to, and your own deity asks the same exact question at the same exact time?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:55:34.396000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878245878257831966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You're 22 years old I'm guessing? Or around that ballpark?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:56:22.427000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878246079714459668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Yep. Both have been with me since the day I was born, and… well, before that too.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:57:06.828000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878246265945726986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Okay. 'Been with me my whole life' is a better measure. Because I am, super old. 22 years is barely my childhood. Trying to put myself in your shoes there was gonna be a struggle.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:58:25.460000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-20T11:58:35.354000Z","id":"878246595752243232","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Yeah. But still. Your whole life they have been with you. Have been there for you. What do you do when they say something that they agree on?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T11:59:57.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878246981556928572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You probably know this whole deal more, but when both you and one other thing in your head want the other thing contained, does it really count as being there for you?\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:02:41.794000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878247670894964766","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"I'm not you. I can't give you a good answer there. But... I would think about how what they want will affect me. I'm kind of with Roy here.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:03:04.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878247766533476403","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“They both wanted the same thing. When does that ever happen?”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:04:02.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878248009652142090","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"Who knows? I wouldn't be surprised if things like that had much different ways of thinking than mortals. But even on mortal scale, I'd say you can pretty much always find one thing that two people agree on.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:05:09.176000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878248289059876885","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"It's not selfish to think about how the actions of others impacts you, you know.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:05:18.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878248329329393684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"\"You're scared to lose Athena. Well, I'm scared to lose Secel.\"","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:05:59.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878248498326302750","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“Maybe it’s for the best. I lost the one man I love, and who I know loved me for me. I’ll loose my family, who would be glad to put me in the ground. I’ve lost something in myself, and I’ll never know what caused me to live.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:09:03.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878249269893677057","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"Irynx frowns at you.","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:09:32.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878249393030066216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"850786156479119391","content":"“I’m serious Irynx. I have no idea how I am not dead.” She balls a fist. “You’ll never know what it was like. I felt their powers inside me, and it was killing me.”","created_at":"2021-08-20T12:12:36.779000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"878250166442950676","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
